    officialEn:'Current U.S. Seller University describes Seller Assistant as an agentic AI inside Seller Center. It can answer questions, reason through issues, suggest next steps, and take actions with seller permission. Its responses may use Academy and policy content, Seller Center workflows, and shop-level signals. Desktop currently exposes a fuller feature set than mobile.',
