    gates:[['Identity','Are the shop, account, product, order, ticket, and region explicit?','Any target is inferred.'],['Evidence','Can the recommendation be checked against the live record?','The answer relies only on generated prose.'],['Consequence','Are price, stock, customer, policy, or payout effects understood?','The downstream effect is unknown.'],['Permission','Is the exact action shown before confirmation?','Consent is broad or ambiguous.'],['Readback','Can the final state be observed independently?','A click or success toast is the only proof.']],
