    nounEn:'violation incident intake', nounZh:'违规事件接收',
    directEn:'In the first 24 hours, do not debate the whole policy or rush into a generic appeal. Preserve every notification, open the exact violation ticket, capture enforcement status and deadline, identify the affected object, save the current listing and supporting evidence, assign one incident owner, and choose the next available path shown in Seller Center.',
