    officialEn:'TikTok Shop says all violations are communicated at least through email and Seller Center Inbox, with additional channels for more serious cases. The ticket shows enforcement actions, status, violation reason, details when applicable, and next steps. A Pending status means correction or appeal may still prevent enforcement if completed successfully before the displayed deadline.',
    officialZh:'TikTok Shop 表示，所有违规至少会通过 Email 与 Seller Center Inbox 通知，更严重事件还会使用更多渠道。Ticket 会显示 Enforcement Action、Status、Violation Reason、适用时的具体 Detail 与 Next Steps。Pending 通常表示在页面截止时间前成功整改或申诉，仍可能阻止处罚生效。',
    gates:[['Notice','Which channels carried the notice and when?','The team relies on a forwarded summary.'],['Ticket','What is the exact ticket, object, reason, and status?','The wrong product or account is being reviewed.'],['Deadline','What timer is visible in the live record?','A remembered policy date replaces the ticket.'],['Evidence','What current state and historical proof must be preserved?','The listing is changed before evidence is saved.'],['Owner','Who decides, submits, and reads the outcome?','Multiple people act without one incident log.']],
    steps:['Capture email, Inbox notice, and ticket URL or ID.','Record status, enforcement, affected object, reason, and visible deadline.','Freeze a copy of the current listing, assets, orders, authorization, or other relevant evidence.','Separate immediate customer or fulfillment risk from the policy response.','Assign one incident owner and one subject-matter reviewer.','Choose only among correction, appeal, quiz, or other options actually shown.','Read back the submitted state and calendar every follow-up deadline.'],
    exampleEn:'A listing receives a Pending violation for inaccurate product details. Before editing, the team captures the ticket, current images, description, product ID, and supplier record. It confirms that Correction is available and that the clock is still open. The listing owner makes the precise factual repair, the incident owner submits the required proof, and both record the Under Review state rather than calling the matter resolved.',
    exampleZh:'某 Listing 因商品信息不准确收到 Pending Violation。编辑前，团队保存 Ticket、当前图片、描述、Product ID 与供应商记录，确认 Correction 可用且倒计时仍开放。Listing Owner 完成准确事实修复，Incident Owner 提交所需证据，并记录 Under Review，而不是提前宣布问题已经解决。',
    sources:['6291506660427575','2380042836166443']
